# marker: PHP_MEM_LIMIT
# applies: dev prod
# Memory (container caps; defaults apply when unset, 0 = unlimited). Rule of thumb:
#   PHP_MEM_LIMIT >= PHP_FPM_MAX_CHILDREN x PHP_MEMORY_LIMIT + ~100m     (defaults: 3 x 128M -> 512m)
# Busy/heavy app example (report/export jobs):
# PHP_MEMORY_LIMIT=256M
# PHP_FPM_MAX_CHILDREN=8
# PHP_MEM_LIMIT=2300m
# WEB_MEM_LIMIT=128m
